<table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Aug 30, 2004 :: New Leader!</div><p align="center"><font size="5">Welcome Synot / Kassandra as the new leader of Capulus!! </font></p><p align="left"><font size="2">The guild will remain as it was created for with Synot at the helm, one of the RL friends who was in Capulus in it's prior incarnation of Stormwatch, and in it's otherworldly incarnation! </font></p><p align="left"><font size="2">Thank you all for being the most wonderful guild I could have ever hoped to have! I've laughed with you and been in awe of your abilities, and willingness to try anything stupid with me! And the amazing successes a small band of friends could do made me proud. </font></p><p align="left"><font size="2">You are truly my family. </font></p><p align="left"><font size="2">What Meeka really meant to say was. Welcome Synot as the guy with the leader tag. But just another one of the family. </font></p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka<br> :: Last edited by Kassandra on Aug 30, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Aug 17, 2004 :: </div><p align="center"><strong><em><font color="#cc0099" size="7">Happy Birthday JAKR!!!</font> </em></strong></p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Aug 16, 2004 :: </div><p><font color="#ff0000" size="7">Happy Birthday Drue! (hug)</font> </p><p /><p>Birthday spankings shall commence, get out your paddles!</p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Jakr<br> :: Last edited by Kassandra on Aug 16, 2004</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jul 11, 2004 :: Grats Schena on your snakey!</div><p>Of course I took no pictures, but I got to watch it happen at least! Grats Schena on your Snakey Epic of Broodness! I'll try to get a picture and add it here later. </p><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Meeka</p></td></tr></table><p /><table class="news-table" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td><div class="title-text">Jul 4, 2004 :: Happy 4th of July</div><strong><em><font color="#ff0000" size="6"><u>Remember to get Drunk.</u></font></em></strong><p class="lastedit"> :: Posted by Kassandra</p></td></tr></table><p /><span class="page-scroll">Pages:  1 <a href='news.asp?page=2'>2</a> <a href='news.asp?page=3'>3</a>...<a href='news.asp?page=15'>15</a>&nbsp;<a href='news.asp?page=2'>&raquo;</a></span></td>
			<td class="panel-cell"><!-- Right Panel Cell -->
